:name: F407 Blink + UART2
:description: 闪灯 + printf 走串口。showAnalyzer 开串口窗,GUI 里实时看输出;无头模式直接打到终端

using sysbus
mach create
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/stm32f4_discovery.repl

$bin?=$ORIGIN/build/blink_uart.elf

showAnalyzer sysbus.usart2

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""
runMacro $reset

start
